        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shop-cta">
        <div class="cal-icon">&#128085;</div>
        <h3>Shop link goes here</h3>
        <p>Spirit Wear is run by PAC. The store link will drop in as a single prominent button.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
